# Reflection sidecar (machine-readable verdicts; regenerated each run from grade())
edge/*.verdicts.json
# NOTE: edge/*.proposed.json (analyst-queued screen variants, Phase-6) is deliberately NOT
# ignored -- unlike verdicts.json it is durable INPUT (the queue the optimizer sweeps), so it
# is committed as the auditable record of what was queued and when.
